24:34.806 --> 24:36.516
Hvad står der?

24:36.600 --> 24:40.770
"IKFC37 er en udfordringsturnering."

24:40.854 --> 24:42.939
"Den afholdes i Seoul i marts."

24:43.023 --> 24:46.318
"Den nye WBC-mester i supermellemvægt,

24:46.401 --> 24:50.947
Kim Gun-woo, Scarface,
deltager i turneringen som favorit."

24:51.823 --> 24:52.991
